    {
      "id": "p0123-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The city of Osaka is rich in culture and history. As a port city and a major financial center, Osaka is associated with commerce, merchants, and shipping. As the comedy capital of Japan, Osaka is where many comedians master their craft before breaking into the mainstream comedy circuit. Osaka is also famous for its food, and is sometimes referred to as \"the nation's kitchen\".",
        "raw": "The city of Osaka is rich in culture and history. As a port city and a\nmajor financial center, Osaka is associated with commerce, merchants,\nand shipping. As the comedy capital of Japan, Osaka is where many\ncomedians master their craft before breaking into the mainstream\ncomedy circuit. Osaka is also famous for its food, and is sometimes\nreferred to as \"the nation's kitchen\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
